From 713cfe0f10d5e52e6e192edaf479890544ac882e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 07:44:23 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(app,ui): plate follow-ups - load notes, rider
 re-checks, square_edges

Dropped plate/on_plate/mod_jaw keys and dangling mounts reach the load
notes; LocateFixture clash-checks a plate's riders; a plate's mesh change
(UpdateModel: re-import, RepairModel) drops its grid and unmounts riders;
square_edges accepts a straight least-or-greatest edge per axis;
MoveFixture::new uses fixture_clash::join; stud refusal prints the
enclosing diameter; save-side warn! on vise/accessory serialise errors;
duplicate fit-height hint removed; MoveFixture split into fixture_move.rs.

Fixes #826

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX
